  "desktop.open": "```flame\ndesktop.fn open(target: String, args: [String]? = []) -> Bool\n```\n\nOpens any URL, custom scheme (e.g. `brave://`, `chrome://`, `https://`), file path, or application. Optionally pass command-line arguments.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.desktop\n\n// Open websites and web apps\ndesktop.open(\"https://google.com\")\n\n// Open custom browser internal schemes\ndesktop.open(\"brave://settings\")\n\n// Open applications with arguments\ndesktop.open(\"code\", [\".\"])\ndesktop.open(\"firefox\", [\"--private-window\", \"https://github.com\"])\n```",
  "std.desktop.open": "```flame\ndesktop.fn open(target: String, args: [String]? = []) -> Bool\n```\n\nOpens any URL, custom scheme (e.g. `brave://`, `chrome://`, `https://`), file path, or application. Optionally pass command-line arguments.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.desktop\n\n// Open websites and web apps\ndesktop.open(\"https://google.com\")\n\n// Open custom browser internal schemes\ndesktop.open(\"brave://settings\")\n\n// Open applications with arguments\ndesktop.open(\"code\", [\".\"])\ndesktop.open(\"firefox\", [\"--private-window\", \"https://github.com\"])\n```",
  "open": "```flame\ndesktop.fn open(target: String, args: [String]? = []) -> Bool\n```\n\nOpens any URL, custom scheme (e.g. `brave://`, `chrome://`, `https://`), file path, or application. Optionally pass command-line arguments.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.desktop\n\n// Open websites and web apps\ndesktop.open(\"https://google.com\")\n\n// Open custom browser internal schemes\ndesktop.open(\"brave://settings\")\n\n// Open applications with arguments\ndesktop.open(\"code\", [\".\"])\ndesktop.open(\"firefox\", [\"--private-window\", \"https://github.com\"])\n```",
