  "os.mem": "```flame\nos.fn mem() -> memStates\n```\n\nReturns the overall system physical memory states in bytes.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.os\n\nlet memory = os.mem()\nprintln($\"Total: {memory.totalMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\nprintln($\"Available: {memory.availableMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\nprintln($\"Used: {memory.usedMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\n```",
  "std.os.mem": "```flame\nos.fn mem() -> memStates\n```\n\nReturns the overall system physical memory states in bytes.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.os\n\nlet memory = os.mem()\nprintln($\"Total: {memory.totalMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\nprintln($\"Available: {memory.availableMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\nprintln($\"Used: {memory.usedMemory / 1024 / 1024} MB\")\n```",
