  "os.processMemory": "```flame\nos.fn processMemory() -> ProcessMemoryInfo\n```\n\nReturns detailed memory and CPU utilization for the currently running process.\n- `rss`: Resident Set Size in bytes\n- `rssMb`: Resident Set Size in Megabytes\n- `virtualMb`: Virtual memory size in Megabytes\n- `cpu`: Instantaneous process CPU usage percentage\n- `cpuTime`: Cumulative CPU time spent in seconds (user + system)\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.os\n\nlet p = os.processMemory()\nprintln($\"Resident Memory: {p.rssMb} MB\")\nprintln($\"Virtual Memory: {p.virtualMb} MB\")\nprintln($\"CPU Usage: {p.cpu}%\")\nprintln($\"CPU Time: {p.cpuTime}s\")\n```",
  "std.os.processMemory": "```flame\nos.fn processMemory() -> ProcessMemoryInfo\n```\n\nReturns detailed memory and CPU utilization for the currently running process.\n- `rss`: Resident Set Size in bytes\n- `rssMb`: Resident Set Size in Megabytes\n- `virtualMb`: Virtual memory size in Megabytes\n- `cpu`: Instantaneous process CPU usage percentage\n- `cpuTime`: Cumulative CPU time spent in seconds (user + system)\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nimport std.os\n\nlet p = os.processMemory()\nprintln($\"Resident Memory: {p.rssMb} MB\")\nprintln($\"Virtual Memory: {p.virtualMb} MB\")\nprintln($\"CPU Usage: {p.cpu}%\")\nprintln($\"CPU Time: {p.cpuTime}s\")\n```",
