  "web.web": "```flame\nweb.fn web(options: Unknown = nil) -> nil\n```\n\nInitializes and mounts the Flame Web application.\n\nIn browser builds, sets up client-side routing and fine-grained reactive DOM rendering.\nWhen run locally via `flame run`, launches the local dev server.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\n@Web\nfn main() {\n    web()\n}\n```",
  "std.web.web": "```flame\nweb.fn web(options: Unknown = nil) -> nil\n```\n\nInitializes and mounts the Flame Web application.\n\nIn browser builds, sets up client-side routing and fine-grained reactive DOM rendering.\nWhen run locally via `flame run`, launches the local dev server.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\n@Web\nfn main() {\n    web()\n}\n```",
  "web": "```flame\nweb.fn web(options: Unknown = nil) -> nil\n```\n\nInitializes and mounts the Flame Web application.\n\nIn browser builds, sets up client-side routing and fine-grained reactive DOM rendering.\nWhen run locally via `flame run`, launches the local dev server.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\n@Web\nfn main() {\n    web()\n}\n```",
  "web.mount": "```flame\nweb.fn mount(selector: String, page: Unknown) -> nil\n```\n\nMounts a component or page to a DOM selector.\n\n**Example:**\n```flame\nmount(\"#app\", index)\n```",
